    "description": "You understand the subtleties and limitations of your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Heuristic_Processor\" title=\"Heuristic Processor\">Heuristic Processor</a>. You can reroll any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Untrained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Untrained\">Untrained</a> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Check\">Skill Check</a> (except <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a>), but the result of the reroll must be accepted, even if it is worse. Once per encounter, you can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to reroll any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Check\">Skill Check</a> (<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Untrained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Untrained\">Untrained</a>), keeping the better of the two results.",
